    ├── Pitfalls   : paho-mqtt is synchronous/callback-based; aiomqtt and gmqtt are asyncio-based and require the calling code (MqttSink.publish) to become 
    │   async or use an event loop bridge; aiomqtt uses async context managers (`async with Client(...) as client`) rather than an instantiate-then-connect 
